  "source_raw_sha256": "d81e929496ff33f8895ebdb45b5b7f3eba89a069806d97d5bbbd7a6c0c032760",
  "offset_convention": "zero-based native UTF-8 byte offsets [start,end); raw source line numbers are 1-based",
  "slice": {
    "anchor_id": "A1.SS1::well-posedness-proof-body",
    "byte_start_inclusive": 534026,
    "byte_end_exclusive": 564876,
    "length_bytes": 30850,
    "line_start_1_based": 2860,
    "line_end_1_based": 2973,
    "raw_sha256": "95b7e4f3a3b668815a209ca915b177cfc9e62ba44ce57a31399b8c21e0cee376"
  },
  "anchors": [
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.SS1.p1.1",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 534026,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 535158,
      "length_bytes": 1132,
      "line_start_1_based": 2860,
      "line_end_1_based": 2862,
      "raw_sha256": "c93c391d62d8e5e701fca75be68f6396344bcf8731ef0776d327590ca967542a",
      "source_text_with_tex": "Fix $y,\\widetilde{x}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d}$. In the notation of ( 3.4 ), the bounce rate ( 3.9 ) reads"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.Ex1",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 535159,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 536544,
      "length_bytes": 1385,
      "line_start_1_based": 2863,
      "line_end_1_based": 2869,
      "raw_sha256": "333b8b86a8cc7e2e1ebd047ae7a9d26bbc95169f2479003a93f399261b9c5132",
      "source_text_with_tex": "$\\lambda_{\\widetilde{x}}(x,p)=\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,[p^{\\top}h_{\\widetilde{x}}(x)]_{+}\\,.$"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.SS1.p1.2",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 536545,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 537310,
      "length_bytes": 765,
      "line_start_1_based": 2870,
      "line_end_1_based": 2872,
      "raw_sha256": "90fb789121f18f89462c64b8d712dde73f232c88cc0132c4008a24c64852cdc8",
      "source_text_with_tex": "The deterministic harmonic flow, namely the solution ( 4.5 ) of ( 3.8 ), and the bounce map are"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.Ex2",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 537387,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 539775,
      "length_bytes": 2388,
      "line_start_1_based": 2875,
      "line_end_1_based": 2879,
      "raw_sha256": "e41027a8c0a916c352772029dc60f460695ee63f9c48c59682c4dd6a5affc544",
      "source_text_with_tex": "$\\displaystyle\\Phi_{t}^{y,\\widetilde{x}}(x,p)$ $\\displaystyle\\coloneqq\\bigl(c_{y,\\widetilde{x}}+(x-c_{y,\\widetilde{x}})\\cos t+\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,p\\sin t,\\;-\\eta^{-1/2}(x-c_{y,\\widetilde{x}})\\sin t+p\\cos t\\bigr)\\,,$"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.Ex3",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 539776,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 541527,
      "length_bytes": 1751,
      "line_start_1_based": 2880,
      "line_end_1_based": 2884,
      "raw_sha256": "4701d72db6d309c593355ed537265f74acfd112521ce3b442117af0939b44ed1",
      "source_text_with_tex": "$\\displaystyle\\mathsf{S}_{\\widetilde{x}}(x,p)$ $\\displaystyle\\coloneqq(x,R_{h_{\\widetilde{x}}(x)}p)\\,,\\hskip 20.00003ptR_{0}\\coloneqq I\\,.$"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.SS1.p1.3",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 541537,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 542236,
      "length_bytes": 699,
      "line_start_1_based": 2886,
      "line_end_1_based": 2887,
      "raw_sha256": "4906734a0bae9af63cc66bcd7db5561b5cbb0ba434ca489572a7ee2cfa7b4890",
      "source_text_with_tex": "The bounce map is an involution. Although there is a possible discontinuity at $h_{\\widetilde{x}}(x)=0$, this creates no ambiguity because the event rate vanishes there."
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.SS1.p2.1",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 542282,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 543847,
      "length_bytes": 1565,
      "line_start_1_based": 2890,
      "line_end_1_based": 2892,
      "raw_sha256": "63d237197e5633aaaa4bd8eae657b46c014d51fd127994d636325db67d2411fb",
      "source_text_with_tex": "Let $(E_{n})_{n\\geq 1}$ be independent $\\operatorname{Exp}(1)$ random variables. Starting from $\\zeta_{0}\\coloneqq(x_{0},p_{0})$ at time $T_{0}\\coloneqq 0$, define recursively"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.E1",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 543924,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 546339,
      "length_bytes": 2415,
      "line_start_1_based": 2895,
      "line_end_1_based": 2900,
      "raw_sha256": "c32f921d7c2c660cab74c6a72f203080785e40ff61135eba64ecbbf9cc35d123",
      "source_text_with_tex": "$\\displaystyle S_{n+1}$ $\\displaystyle\\coloneqq\\inf\\Bigl\\{u\\geq 0:\\int_{0}^{u}\\lambda_{\\widetilde{x}}(\\Phi_{s}^{y,\\widetilde{x}}(\\zeta_{T_{n}}))\\,\\mathrm{d}s\\geq E_{n+1}\\Bigr\\}\\,,$ (A.1)"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.E2",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 546340,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 548583,
      "length_bytes": 2243,
      "line_start_1_based": 2901,
      "line_end_1_based": 2906,
      "raw_sha256": "afef0bf4bff7cc69a0057daa20449a732079a0af9afbb92763de81b089b82297",
      "source_text_with_tex": "$\\displaystyle T_{n+1}$ $\\displaystyle\\coloneqq T_{n}+S_{n+1}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\zeta_{T_{n+1}}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{S}_{\\widetilde{x}}\\bigl(\\Phi_{S_{n+1}}^{y,\\widetilde{x}}(\\zeta_{T_{n}})\\bigr)\\,,$ (A.2)"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.SS1.p2.2",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 548593,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 550571,
      "length_bytes": 1978,
      "line_start_1_based": 2908,
      "line_end_1_based": 2911,
      "raw_sha256": "09f9ddea64136444d2c06ba5d635bed3114292fec9c97fd32730bfc4a7ada6fd",
      "source_text_with_tex": "when $S_{n+1}<\\infty$. If the set is empty, set $T_{n+1}=S_{n+1}=\\infty$ and stop the recursion. Between jumps, set $\\zeta_{T_{n}+t}=\\Phi_{t}^{y,\\widetilde{x}}(\\zeta_{T_{n}})$ for $0\\leq t<S_{n+1}$."
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.SS1.p3.1",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 550617,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 550762,
      "length_bytes": 145,
      "line_start_1_based": 2914,
      "line_end_1_based": 2914,
      "raw_sha256": "7d88f2e0ad4c34c0fd528bdd1c975cf71d65823c2bb0fb1efd94193c833bb1e3",
      "source_text_with_tex": "To prove non-explosion, define the shifted harmonic energy"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.Ex4",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 550763,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 552476,
      "length_bytes": 1713,
      "line_start_1_based": 2915,
      "line_end_1_based": 2921,
      "raw_sha256": "b58f8b5406d4d4a404001b1d93ec1a87499c2f62a86e22656549e59a6fda5076",
      "source_text_with_tex": "$H_{y,\\widetilde{x}}(x,p)\\coloneqq\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\bigl\\{\\eta^{-1}\\,\\|x-c_{y,\\widetilde{x}}\\|^{2}+\\|p\\|^{2}\\bigr\\}\\,.$"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.SS1.p3.2",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 552477,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 553337,
      "length_bytes": 860,
      "line_start_1_based": 2922,
      "line_end_1_based": 2924,
      "raw_sha256": "bfd07a89ff4b7a360dca5e0e57b1940a9d6d8a32cdff46f132186aa69897a078",
      "source_text_with_tex": "The flow and each bounce preserve this energy. Hence, with $\\mathcal{E}\\coloneqq H_{y,\\widetilde{x}}(x_{0},p_{0})$, every state produced by the recursion satisfies"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.Ex5",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 553338,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 554758,
      "length_bytes": 1420,
      "line_start_1_based": 2925,
      "line_end_1_based": 2931,
      "raw_sha256": "60bcba6175c149d0676e3a3a335682826dedea369ae33b986453c68066c8e515",
      "source_text_with_tex": "$\\|p\\|\\leq\\sqrt{2\\mathcal{E}}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\|x-c_{y,\\widetilde{x}}\\|\\leq\\sqrt{2\\eta\\mathcal{E}}\\,.$"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.SS1.p3.3",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 554759,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 556250,
      "length_bytes": 1491,
      "line_start_1_based": 2932,
      "line_end_1_based": 2933,
      "raw_sha256": "ce47b46c3ede6f7f55dd899683df4c14d1db7e14f06d90b34a6909652577fe88",
      "source_text_with_tex": "Because $\\nabla V$ is $\\beta$-Lipschitz, $\\lambda_{\\widetilde{x}}(x,p)\\leq\\bar{\\lambda}_{\\mathcal{E}}(y,\\widetilde{x})$ throughout the path, where"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.Ex6",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 556251,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 558334,
      "length_bytes": 2083,
      "line_start_1_based": 2934,
      "line_end_1_based": 2940,
      "raw_sha256": "d58ee6b4d2a2bdd0a4c961848b0166a5edf316aba1900724151652cccd658e84",
      "source_text_with_tex": "$\\bar{\\lambda}_{\\mathcal{E}}(y,\\widetilde{x})\\coloneqq\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,\\beta\\sqrt{2\\mathcal{E}}\\,\\bigl\\{\\sqrt{2\\eta\\mathcal{E}}+\\|c_{y,\\widetilde{x}}-\\widetilde{x}\\|\\bigr\\}\\,.$"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.SS1.p3.4",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 558335,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 558428,
      "length_bytes": 93,
      "line_start_1_based": 2941,
      "line_end_1_based": 2941,
      "raw_sha256": "8d6388928d508e646c2bad42e4b5433b38b4b2fe465fea62fab09a7196f33f04",
      "source_text_with_tex": "Hence,"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.Ex7",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 558429,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 560337,
      "length_bytes": 1908,
      "line_start_1_based": 2942,
      "line_end_1_based": 2948,
      "raw_sha256": "dce58599c780d0f17922c16107c58ac3fce2a0659c71b8317ef01e050365820a",
      "source_text_with_tex": "$\\int_{0}^{u}\\lambda_{\\widetilde{x}}(\\Phi_{s}^{y,\\widetilde{x}}(\\zeta_{T_{n}}))\\,\\mathrm{d}s\\leq\\bar{\\lambda}_{\\mathcal{E}}(y,\\widetilde{x})\\,u\\,.$"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.SS1.p3.5",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 560338,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 561547,
      "length_bytes": 1209,
      "line_start_1_based": 2949,
      "line_end_1_based": 2951,
      "raw_sha256": "fa398ef1e92c95870b9a971a8f1959d3c0514931c36455dd025df770f152a560",
      "source_text_with_tex": "If $\\bar{\\lambda}_{\\mathcal{E}}(y,\\widetilde{x})=0$, the event rate vanishes and there are no jumps. Otherwise, ( A.1 ) implies, for every finite waiting time,"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.Ex8",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 561548,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 562707,
      "length_bytes": 1159,
      "line_start_1_based": 2952,
      "line_end_1_based": 2958,
      "raw_sha256": "7b297052ac0e850e5cef0389c9802f89886d43913d8943bced148dd98bf734cd",
      "source_text_with_tex": "$S_{n+1}\\geq\\frac{E_{n+1}}{\\bar{\\lambda}_{\\mathcal{E}}(y,\\widetilde{x})}\\,.$"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.SS1.p3.6",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 562708,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 562847,
      "length_bytes": 139,
      "line_start_1_based": 2959,
      "line_end_1_based": 2959,
      "raw_sha256": "da37355b8f6774978ec5bb1dc5d01b9495de0113235e05dc63ee7309586529c1",
      "source_text_with_tex": "If the recursion does not terminate, it follows that"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.Ex9",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 562848,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 564116,
      "length_bytes": 1268,
      "line_start_1_based": 2960,
      "line_end_1_based": 2966,
      "raw_sha256": "9aece5e3e4962e03be2aa4d46452bbea0cc40d16578458e8110bf3ef56e5000c",
      "source_text_with_tex": "$T_{n}\\geq\\frac{\\sum_{j=1}^{n}E_{j}}{\\bar{\\lambda}_{\\mathcal{E}}(y,\\widetilde{x})}\\longrightarrow\\infty$"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.SS1.p3.7",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 564117,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 564876,
      "length_bytes": 759,
      "line_start_1_based": 2967,
      "line_end_1_based": 2973,
      "raw_sha256": "403d8ba6092b60dce9b3bbdc1c10f07530b20434920a058df2bc236adac0d4e3",
      "source_text_with_tex": "almost surely by the strong law of large numbers. Thus, the jump times cannot accumulate, and the recursive construction defines a unique process for all $t\\geq 0$. Finally, the memoryless property of the exponential clocks gives the time-homogeneous Markov property. This is precisely the integrated hazard construction of Davis [ 12 , Section 2] . ∎"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.SS1.p2.1::independent-unit-exponential-clocks",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 542358,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 543086,
      "length_bytes": 728,
      "line_start_1_based": 2890,
      "line_end_1_based": 2891,
      "raw_sha256": "cd7a7a662d5fbbc6e89827ae7b7a46eef717c523c51e9ebeda40f99dcf9a1bff",
      "source_text_with_tex": "Let $(E_{n})_{n\\geq 1}$ be independent $\\operatorname{Exp}(1)$ random variables."
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.SS1.p3.7::SLLN-sentence",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 564193,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 564242,
      "length_bytes": 49,
      "line_start_1_based": 2967,
      "line_end_1_based": 2967,
      "raw_sha256": "7d180e13d1ebb43fe9a8a77013b53ea143db0a904911f05bbc3381f5dc2a274c",
      "source_text_with_tex": "almost surely by the strong law of large numbers."
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.SS1.p3.7::process-conclusion",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 564243,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 564681,
      "length_bytes": 438,
      "line_start_1_based": 2967,
      "line_end_1_based": 2971,
      "raw_sha256": "79cc32c01c7b71c1dfa776f3a589743722f77cf399d0028c0a9d96cfa2648f89",
      "source_text_with_tex": "Thus, the jump times cannot accumulate, and the recursive construction defines a unique process for all $t\\geq 0$. Finally, the memoryless property of the exponential clocks gives the time-homogeneous Markov property."
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "A1.SS1.p3.7::Davis-citation",
      "byte_start_inclusive": 564682,
      "byte_end_exclusive": 564861,
      "length_bytes": 179,
      "line_start_1_based": 2971,
      "line_end_1_based": 2972,
      "raw_sha256": "af0ee21cb872d2f3c0c572001318a02fa4a9baef886c040950710583412445c4",
      "source_text_with_tex": "This is precisely the integrated hazard construction of Davis [ 12 , Section 2] ."
    }
  ]
}
